{"content_hash": "69781896a36d4400", "version_id": 984, "article_id": 99, "level_code": "en_b2", "lang": "en", "level": 4, "level_label": "B2 中高级", "title": "12.5 million Americans plan to skip work for GTA 6", "title_zh": "1250万美国人打算为《GTA6》请假", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "ithome", "source_url": "https://www.ithome.com/1/027/486.htm", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1717501216174-9dc275fe680d?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8M3x8bWFnfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTQ3OTE3ODd8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Doriana Popa on Unsplash", "author": "Doriana Popa", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@ibreathart?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-table-topped-with-a-cake-and-flowers-XtPq1tkY7sA?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(82, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(120, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "7ee29fdf7be5"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-16", "word_count": 250, "reading_minutes": 1.2, "lead": "A new survey by PC Mag suggests that around 12.5 million American players will take time off work or school when GTA 6 arrives on November 19. Most others, however, say they will wait.", "lead_zh": "PC Mag 的一项新调查显示，约1250万美国玩家打算在11月19日《GTA6》发售时请假或调整上课时间。不过，多数人表示他们会再等等。", "preview": "According to the report, 8% of adult players in the United States plan to take paid leave or rearrange their work or study schedules on Nove", "preview_zh": "据报道，8%的美国成年玩家计划在11月19日请带薪假，或调整工作、上学时间，以便游戏一发售就能玩上《GTA6》。根据这一比例，研究人员推算出，大约有1250万美国玩家打算为这款开放世界游戏专门腾出时间。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 967, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/99/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 94.5, "size_bytes": 567936, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 283, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/99/en_b2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 95.7, "size_bytes": 575136, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 283, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/99/en_b2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/99/en_b2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 103.075, "size_bytes": 619344, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 283, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/99/en_b2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/99/en_b2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 89.0, "size_bytes": 534960, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 283, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/99/en_b2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/99/en_b2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 95.6, "size_bytes": 574560, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 283, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/99/en_b2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@1b079706/content/data/versions/984.json", "paragraphs": ["According to the report, 8% of adult players in the United States plan to take paid leave or rearrange their work or study schedules on November 19 so that they can play GTA 6 as soon as it is released. Based on this figure, the researchers calculated that roughly 12.5 million American players intend to set aside time for the open-world game.", "Younger players appear the most eager. Among Generation Z players, 13% said they would change their plans for the launch, the highest share of any age group. Since GTA 6 will only run on current-generation consoles, 7% of those surveyed said they plan to upgrade their equipment for this game or for other major releases like it.", "Not everyone is willing to give up a whole day. About 3% of players plan to take two days off or more, while another 3% will take a full day and 2% will ask for half a day or adjust their working hours. In addition, 14% intend to use their normal free time to play, and 4% will set aside evenings and weekends for the game.", "Still, the majority are in no hurry. Around 68% of those questioned said they have no plans to play GTA 6 on the first day. The survey was carried out by YouGov Plc for PC Mag between October 23 and 27, 2026, and covered 2,024 adults, of whom 1,154 qualified as gamers. The data was weighted to represent all US adults aged 18 and over."], "paragraphs_zh": ["据报道，8%的美国成年玩家计划在11月19日请带薪假，或调整工作、上学时间，以便游戏一发售就能玩上《GTA6》。根据这一比例，研究人员推算出，大约有1250万美国玩家打算为这款开放世界游戏专门腾出时间。", "年轻玩家显得最为积极。在Z世代玩家中，13%表示会为发售调整自己的安排，这一比例在所有年龄组中最高。由于《GTA6》只登陆当前世代主机，7%的受访者表示，他们打算为这款游戏或其他类似重磅新作升级设备。", "并非所有人都愿意空出一整天。约3%的玩家计划请假两天或更久，另有3%会请整整一天，2%打算请半天假或调整工作时间。此外，14%的人打算利用平时的空闲时间游玩，4%会把晚上和周末留给游戏。", "不过，大多数人并不着急。约68%的受访者表示，他们没有在发售首日玩《GTA6》的打算。此次调查由YouGov Plc为PC Mag开展，时间为2026年10月23日至27日，共覆盖2024名成年人，其中1154人符合玩家条件。数据经过加权处理，可代表美国18岁及以上全体成年人。"], "body": "According to the report, 8% of adult players in the United States plan to take paid leave or rearrange their work or study schedules on November 19 so that they can play GTA 6 as soon as it is released. Based on this figure, the researchers calculated that roughly 12.5 million American players intend to set aside time for the open-world game.\n\nYounger players appear the most eager. Among Generation Z players, 13% said they would change their plans for the launch, the highest share of any age group. Since GTA 6 will only run on current-generation consoles, 7% of those surveyed said they plan to upgrade their equipment for this game or for other major releases like it.\n\nNot everyone is willing to give up a whole day. About 3% of players plan to take two days off or more, while another 3% will take a full day and 2% will ask for half a day or adjust their working hours. In addition, 14% intend to use their normal free time to play, and 4% will set aside evenings and weekends for the game.\n\nStill, the majority are in no hurry. Around 68% of those questioned said they have no plans to play GTA 6 on the first day. The survey was carried out by YouGov Plc for PC Mag between October 23 and 27, 2026, and covered 2,024 adults, of whom 1,154 qualified as gamers. The data was weighted to represent all US adults aged 18 and over.", "body_zh": "据报道，8%的美国成年玩家计划在11月19日请带薪假，或调整工作、上学时间，以便游戏一发售就能玩上《GTA6》。根据这一比例，研究人员推算出，大约有1250万美国玩家打算为这款开放世界游戏专门腾出时间。\n\n年轻玩家显得最为积极。在Z世代玩家中，13%表示会为发售调整自己的安排，这一比例在所有年龄组中最高。由于《GTA6》只登陆当前世代主机，7%的受访者表示，他们打算为这款游戏或其他类似重磅新作升级设备。\n\n并非所有人都愿意空出一整天。约3%的玩家计划请假两天或更久，另有3%会请整整一天，2%打算请半天假或调整工作时间。此外，14%的人打算利用平时的空闲时间游玩，4%会把晚上和周末留给游戏。\n\n不过，大多数人并不着急。约68%的受访者表示，他们没有在发售首日玩《GTA6》的打算。此次调查由YouGov Plc为PC Mag开展，时间为2026年10月23日至27日，共覆盖2024名成年人，其中1154人符合玩家条件。数据经过加权处理，可代表美国18岁及以上全体成年人。", "text": "According to the report, 8% of adult players in the United States plan to take paid leave or rearrange their work or study schedules on November 19 so that they can play GTA 6 as soon as it is released. Based on this figure, the researchers calculated that roughly 12.5 million American players intend to set aside time for the open-world game. Younger players appear the most eager. Among Generation Z players, 13% said they would change their plans for the launch, the highest share of any age group. Since GTA 6 will only run on current-generation consoles, 7% of those surveyed said they plan to upgrade their equipment for this game or for other major releases like it. Not everyone is willing to give up a whole day. About 3% of players plan to take two days off or more, while another 3% will take a full day and 2% will ask for half a day or adjust their working hours. In addition, 14% intend to use their normal free time to play, and 4% will set aside evenings and weekends for the game. Still, the majority are in no hurry. Around 68% of those questioned said they have no plans to play GTA 6 on the first day. The survey was carried out by YouGov Plc for PC Mag between October 23 and 27, 2026, and covered 2,024 adults, of whom 1,154 qualified as gamers. The data was weighted to represent all US adults aged 18 and over.", "vocab": [{"word": "take time off", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "请假；抽出时间休息", "note": "常与 work/school 搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "paid leave", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "带薪假", "note": "正式职场用语", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "rearrange", "pos": "verb", "zh": "重新安排", "note": "比 change 更强调调整顺序", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "schedule", "pos": "noun", "zh": "日程；时间表", "note": "也可作动词，意为安排", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "calculate", "pos": "verb", "zh": "计算；推算", "note": "调查数据常用词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "roughly", "pos": "adv", "zh": "大约；粗略地", "note": "近似数字前常用", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "intend to", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "打算；有意", "note": "比 plan to 稍正式", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "eager", "pos": "adj", "zh": "热切的；渴望的", "note": "be eager to do sth", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "console", "pos": "noun", "zh": "游戏主机", "note": "如 PlayStation、Xbox", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "upgrade", "pos": "verb", "zh": "升级；更新设备", "note": "upgrade to 升级到", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "set aside", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "留出；拨出", "note": "常接时间或金钱", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "weighted", "pos": "adj", "zh": "经过加权处理的", "note": "统计调查术语", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-16T01:16:24.797609", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "According", "s": 0.275, "e": 0.725, "sm": 275, "em": 725, "cs": 0, "ce": 9, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "to", "s": 0.725, "e": 0.812, "sm": 725, "em": 812, "cs": 10, "ce": 12, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "the", "s": 0.812, "e": 0.9, "sm": 812, "em": 900, "cs": 13, "ce": 16, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "report", "s": 0.9, "e": 1.65, "sm": 900, "em":